,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_05_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_05_47","text":"There is, however, another problem that might be even bigger than the Gatekeeper.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_05_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_05_48","text":"The prevailing question right now is: what do we do with the Devil Hunters while we wait for the research team's findings?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_05_49","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_05_49","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_05_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_05_50","text":"They've been nothing but cooperative since they first appeared,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_05_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_05_51","text":"and they have never acted in a threatening manner.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_05_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_05_52","text":"I've therefore determined that they pose no threat to you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_05_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_05_53","text":"As of now, the Devi